WEBVTT

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:38.620
Kiriya-kun!

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.990
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:44.660
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:47.430
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:51.900
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.600
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:57.740
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.340
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.340
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.140
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.950
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.920
<i>we both</i>

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.250
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:16.820
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:20.830
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:23.390
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:26.560
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.130
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:35.310
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:36.610
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.080
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:42.110
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:46.380
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.450
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:53.190
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:07.750
No matter what form you take, the 
result will still be the same!

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:11.990
The Power of Creation within 
your body will become mine

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:15.040
no matter what.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.820
I can't let you do that...

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:21.800
We are better suited to 
rule the darkness now.

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:26.990
I cannot hand over the future 
of the world of darkness to you.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.930
We are no longer what 
we were until yesterday.

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:35.760
What can you do with that decaying body?

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:44.370
You must know that the Power 
of Creation is immeasurable.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:47.450
There is no way that you 
people can manipulate it.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:50.110
I wonder about that.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.650
"THE WORLD'S GREATEST BATTLE! 
PRETTY CURE'S LAST DAY!!"

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.490
Are you okay?

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:33.960
What's going on anyway?

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:41.790
Where are we?

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.620
It only took a moment 
for us to get here mepo!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.640
But we're still in Dotsuku Zone mipo.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.880
Kiriya-kun... Why did you save us?

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.730
I thought we'd never see each other again.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:03.660
Ever since then, I've been wandering between 
the threshold of light and darkness.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.120
The threshold between light and darkness?

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.950
That's the only thing someone like me,

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.100
who has followed the world 
of darkness, can do.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.580
Wondering how I should live my life...

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.690
And even before that, wondering 
if I really am alive...

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:24.530
Then, why don't you live on the Field 
of Rainbows together with us...

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:25.710
Like before.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:27.030
It's impossible.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.960
I live in the world of darkness...

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.550
And besides...

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:34.990
What...?

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:38.490
There's a warp opening 
between light and darkness.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:42.400
Soon, all the worlds will 
be wrapped in darkness.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:44.260
Even the Field of Light, 
and the Field of Rainbows.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:48.000
You're saying that they're 
going to make it happen?

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.970
No matter who wins, the 
result will be the same.

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:53.820
Whoever gets the Power 
of Creation will control

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:57.240
the darkness, and cover 
everything in darkness.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:01.380
We won't let them do it!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.250
But it's too late, isn't it?

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:05.950
It can't be!

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:12.650
I'm destined to wander between 
light and darkness forever.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:22.770
Kiriya-kun...

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.840
Take us...

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.550
All right. The Field of 
Rainbows will probably

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.440
be safer than staying here.

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:31.170
No...

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:34.550
We want you to take us back to Jyaku-King.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:40.350
But if you do that...

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.580
It may be too late,

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.560
but we can't just stand 
by and watch it happen.

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:49.630
At this rate, either way, everything 
will be covered in darkness, won't it?

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:55.370
We came here to get the 
Power of Creation back.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:59.300
We're the only ones who can 
carve out our destinies.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.240
Please...

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:08.180
What in the world makes you do that anyway?

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.830
Wait a minute!

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.040
You don't give up, do you?

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:35.040
We won't let you use the Power 
of Creation the way you want!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:38.190
I'm tired of hearing that nonsense!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.670
We won't give up!

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:47.190
I'll show you the power of 
the stones that you want.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:52.960
He's huge!

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:00.600
He's fast!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.990
White! Let's use the Marble Screw!

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.180
It's no use!

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:56.290
The Marble Screw won't work on him mepo!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.250
I know that...

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:01.380
I know, but that's all we have!

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.330
We have no choice... We have to try it.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:15.110
Black Thunder!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.580
White Thunder!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:28.020
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.860
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:35.490
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:48.440
It's useless to even try it!

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.450
Legendary warriors!

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.680
This is where your fairy tale ends!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:09.690
Black!

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:11.160
White!

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:20.740
It's impossible, after all.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:26.310
Popo!

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:29.640
You mustn't pick on Pretty Cula popo!

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.050
Popopo... no... popopo...

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:34.920
Those little girls must be having 
a rough time in Dotsuku Zone...

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:36.450
Aren't they?

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.420
They're in trouble popo!

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.060
This is so aggravating!

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:43.390
Can't I do anything other than sit 
here, and wring my hands like this?

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.040
Popopo... Popopo...

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.230
I'm going to save them popo!

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:51.700
How are you going to save them?

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:02.710
Accept the power of light popo!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:12.990
Popo...?

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:16.820
We don't have the power of the stones, and

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.060
even if we did, it would 
never reach Dotsuku Zone.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:22.270
It won't reach... It won't reach...

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:25.990
Pretty Cula!

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:30.780
Even knowing the girls are in danger, 
there's nothing we can do...

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:34.150
Am I so powerless...?

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.560
White! Run away mipo!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:53.260
Black! Get up mepo!

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:04.980
Popo...! Popo...

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:08.710
Pollun!

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.920
Calm down, Pollun...

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:12.880
That voice...

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.520
Senior!

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:25.290
Listen, Pollun...

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:28.870
Queen is desperately trying to 
support the Field of Light,

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:33.570
so if she leaves here, the 
Field of Light will perish!

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:36.840
So you and Wisdom must do your best, Pollun!

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.060
Popo...?

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.920
Pollun and me...?

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:51.190
If the two of you join forces, 
you can do something.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.480
Believe in your own powers.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.590
You're the only ones who 
can save Pretty Cure.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:59.560
How do we join forces...?

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:00.860
Popo...

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:05.770
Pollun... Remember who you are...

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:10.810
You are the Prince of Light who will 
guide us to the future, Pollun.

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:16.180
Are you prepared?

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.710
Popopopopopo...!

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:30.730
Popo! You and I will save Pretty Cure popo!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.330
Do this popo...

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:37.420
Popopo...

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:39.640
Do this popo...!

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.510
Just do as I say popo!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:51.200
I am Pollun, the Price of Light, 
who will guide us to the future...

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:54.890
I am Wisdom, the keeper who will 
protect the Power of Creation!

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:58.030
Deliver our power...

00:12:58.030 --> 00:13:00.860
Accept the power of light popo!

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:03.590
Did I just say "popo"?

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:11.770
Popo!

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.710
Popopopopopopopo...

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.370
Popopopopo...

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.790
Come on...!

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.630
Rainbow...

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:02.390
Bracelets...

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:08.230
Kiriya-kun...

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.190
Thank you.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.730
It couldn't be... Pollun mipo?

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:15.970
He doesn't have the power of the stones mepo!

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.930
In order for it to reach Dotsuku Zone...

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:21.040
Stone Keeper must have helped him mipo!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.740
Pollun and Stone Keeper...?

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:24.210
That's awesome...!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.140
Thank you, Pollun! Thank you, Stone Keeper!

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:28.820
Ready, White?

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:32.180
We won't let everyone's efforts go to waste!

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:10.750
I wonder if it reached them...

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.540
I don't know popo.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.030
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.500
And fight your way toward the future!

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:28.120
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.630
As long as I have the power of the stones...

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:20.490
The Power of Creation inside him is 
reacting to the Rainbow Storm mepo!

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:24.630
That can't be...! It can't be!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.290
Awesome!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:35.500
I told you that you would never be 
able to control the Power of Creation!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.440
Dark warriors...

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:45.120
This is the end of your foolish dream.

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.820
What's happening?

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:55.390
I don't know...

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.630
Jyaku-King is trying to swallow 
the dark warriors mepo.

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:01.600
What a frightening thing to do mipo!

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:34.850
He swallowed them all up...

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:37.540
Does that mean that he swallowed the Power of

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:39.400
Creation along with them?

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:42.610
The power of the stones has fallen 
into the hands of Jyaku-King mepo!

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:45.180
Forcefully swallowing them 
up like that is the worst

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:46.810
thing that could happen mipo!

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:06.130
He swallowed the Power of Creation

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:10.270
along with the dark warriors!

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:14.600
What we feared has turned into reality...

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:18.640
At this rate, everything will 
be swallowed up by darkness.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:27.340
I have finally attained eternal life...

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:30.980
Everything will now be 
controlled by darkness.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:32.620
What are we going to do?

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:35.370
At this rate, everything will 
be swallowed up by darkness.

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:37.520
Can we stop him...?

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.630
We have no choice... We have to try.

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:43.800
You're right. That's what 
we made up our minds to do.

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:47.410
It's not over yet.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.540
We won't let you do a you please anymore.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.470
It's too late.

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:56.110
The future will exist only 
in the world of darkness.

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.550
Everything will be wrapped 
in darkness, and...

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:02.560
And I will live in the still of darkness...

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:04.050
For all eternity.

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:14.400
Try the Rainbow Storm one more time mepo.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.600
It's no good... I can't 
get close enough to White.

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.310
Run away mipo!

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.310
No! I won't! That's the last thing I'll do.

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.210
Give it up!

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.080
This is the end!

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.070
It's no use mipo!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.770
Little girls... Please be safe.

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:04.500
Popo...

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:15.910
Popo!

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:21.980
Black!

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.070
White!

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:26.400
Pollun!

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:27.760
Stone Keeper!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.220
We're back.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:31.880
What's going on?

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.580
You were saved mepo!

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:35.810
Just in the nick of time mipo!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:39.050
Because of the breakdown 
in the balance between

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.460
light and darkness, there 
were gaps here and there...

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.290
You just happened to fall into one of them.

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:45.970
That's why we were saved.

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:49.900
But as long as he has the Power of Creation,

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:51.760
we'll be swallowed by darkness.

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:54.470
We have to go back there.

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:56.670
But how are you going to fight him mipo?

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:59.140
There's no way you can win 
against the likes of him mepo!

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:00.310
Popo...

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:02.370
Popopopopopo...

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.340
What is it this time?

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:15.390
That's...?

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.330
It can't be!

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:26.000
I didn't think he would follow us here mepo!

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:29.130
The Field of Rainbows will be 
swallowed up by darkness mipo!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.590
Legendary warriors...

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:45.610
You're the only thing that 
hampers my eternal life.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:52.240
It was supposed to be a simple 
thing to take the Power of Creation

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.430
from the Field of Light...

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:58.000
Until you appeared.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:05.610
For the future of darkness, I must 
bury the legendary warriors forever.

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:13.140
He was after Pretty Cure...

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:15.450
That's why he came here mipo.

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:16.880
That can't be!

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:19.750
No way!

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:26.790
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:29.490
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.590 --> 00:22:32.230
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.940
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.070
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:47.780
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:51.520
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:55.250
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.620
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:06.260
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:10.640
<i>I'm a teenager with a</i>

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>heart throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:16.610
<i>I don't want to lose that</i>

00:23:16.610 --> 00:23:20.380
<i>normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:22.880
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.350
<i>It's romance rather than stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.520
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:31.820
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:34.860
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:38.130
<i>I'd rather cuddle than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.370
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:42.900
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:44.300
<i>So why am I</i>

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:45.900
<i>stuffing my face</i>

00:23:45.970 --> 00:23:49.610
<i>with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:54.140 --> 00:23:55.620
Is this complete darkness...?

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.060
Is it the power of complete darkness?

00:23:57.060 --> 00:23:58.330
What is this feeling?

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.350
I feel like ice is piercing 
deep down into my very soul.

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:01.640
We're no match for him...

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:02.450
What are we supposed to do?

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:03.870
Is this the end?

00:24:03.870 --> 00:24:05.760
No, it's not! I won't let it end!

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:06.900
For everyone's sake!

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:08.160
For our own sake!

00:24:08.870 --> 00:24:14.230
"BELIEVE IN THE FUTURE! BELIEVE IN TOMORROW!
 WE WON'T LET YOU SAY GOODBYE!!"

00:24:14.530 --> 00:24:15.330
We're going to...

00:24:15.330 --> 00:24:16.780
...build our future!

00:24:16.780 --> 00:24:18.290
For our sake!

00:24:18.290 --> 00:24:19.520
For everyone's sake!
